        {
          "text": " Kotema Manoa emalaika loka EJAKAIT ebe, “Keŋaiŋait kosalak ber ijo tetere sio kipuikini jo ikalol.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
